.TH NOTM-AUTOMATION 7 "2026-06-26" "notm 0.1.0" "Miscellaneous"
.SH NAME
notm-automation \- deprecated name for the notm developer test harness
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B notm-automation
is the old name for the developer test-harness documentation.  The current
manual page is
.BR notm-test-harness (7).
.PP
The old
.B --automation
CLI flags are compatibility aliases for the preferred
.B --test-harness
flags.  New documentation and examples should use the test-harness name.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR notm-test-harness (7),
.BR notm (1),
.BR notm-config (5)
